## Checkpoint linkage

The weights file loaded by the application is the `.h5`; its SHA-256 is the `weights_sha256` of the checkpoint card,
recomputed on the file and equal to `models/weights/manifest.json`. Card counts n_train / n_val / n_test and the test
counts per class must equal the rows of the corresponding manifests (`cnn_*` for official, `pooled_*` for pooled).

